          <note>Periappā Kavi had apparently the same age as Śrīdhara Veṅkaṭeśa (see Raghavan, Venkataraman. Śāhendravilāsa of Śrīdhara Veṅkaṭeśa (A Poem on the Life of King Śāhaji of Tanjore, 1684-1710). Tiruchi: The Kalyan Press, 1952: p. 64). I therefore use the same dates as reported in Śrīdhara Veṅkaṭeśa's entry.</note>
          <note>Given the title of Kavitārkikasārvabhauma by Kṛṣṇānanda Sarasvatī, as evident from the prologue to the Śṛṅgāramañjarīśāhajīya</note>
